<br><font size=2 face="sans-serif">thanks everyone .....I seams like I have to do some environment &nbsp;setting manually. I'll try this after christmas ..thanks for the friends who replied. Here is one of the solution I got.. ( </font><font size=1 face="sans-serif"><b>&quot;Davis, Alan&quot; &lt;Davis@tessco.com</b></font><font size=2 face="sans-serif">)</font>
