thanks to
Tom Blinn,
Jeffrey Hummel,
Alan,

The consensus was that i should get a new disk.

The error is that a allocated block on the disk faild and that the disk
firmware itself tried
reassign that block but that doesnt work.
You could as well use the scu utility manually with the reassign option.

