-----Original Message-----
rc.config got wiped out on XP1000 running 4.0F.
I have restored almost everything without any problems, except for
PAGERAW, PAGEFILE, PARTITION and PARTITIONTYPE entries.

I could restore these entries manually except for PARTITIONTYPE.
I am not sure what it should be.

