Hi all,

	Thomas Blinn suggested that i run the /sbin/advfs/verify command on
the advfs domain after unmounting the filesets belonging to that domain.
	I was unable to unmount the filesets as my oracle database had a
datafile residing on one of the filesets and since the advfs domain was not
accessible, 
	i could not even shutdown the database.
	I therefore, brought the system down to the single user mode and to
my surprise i was allowed access to this particular domain. I still did run
the verify 	command on the domain and then moved to the multiuser mode.
	All's fine now.
	
	I'm extremely thankful to Thomas Blinn for his prompt response.

Regards,
