Dear managers,
=20
I am facing a problem while booting the ES40 Tru64 unix server. It is
not booting. No messages are appearing on the console screen during the
boot. Below are the messages which are displaying on the front panel
screen :
=20
System DC is ok
Verify Fan Speed
SROM V2.0
SROM 0 BC ECC
SROM 0 MEM INIT  (System beeps once)
JUMP TO CONSOLE
TESTING MEMORY
STARTING DRIVERS
SRM V5.9-24
=20
=20
The system hangs at this stage.
=20
=20
Please let me know what could be the reason?.=20
Thanks in advance
=20
Best Regards,
Joseph=20
